ced a majority investment from Warburg Pincus, the pioneer of global growth investing.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:31a65e800d3f9e351844e0fd6ef601f4","date":"2026-03-10","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Hale (HCLF2 and HCILF2 logistics vehicles)","portco_name":null,"target_website":"hale.com.au","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Oxford Properties"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":750000000.0,"currency":"AUD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Hale Secures ~A$750 Million for Second Vintage Logistics Series Backed by Global Institutional Investors","summary":"Australian logistics manager Hale closed about A$750 million of equity commitments for its second-vintage vehicles, re-anchored by Warburg Pincus and Oxford Properties.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/03/10/hale-secures-a750-million-for-second-vintage-logistics-series-backed-by-global-institutional-investors/","evidence":"Sydney, Australia, March 10, 2026 — Hale, a vertically integrated Australian logistics manager and developer with A$3.3 billion in AUM[1], today announced the closing of approximately A$750 million in new equity commitments, marking the successful capital raise of the firm’s two flagship investment vehicles, HCLF2 and HCILF2.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:8db907fbfa8f567a54965b812cca077c","date":"2026-03-02","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Global Eggs","portco_name":"Global Eggs","target_website":"globaleggs.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus Capital Solutions Founders Fund","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1000000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":8000000000.0,"valuation_currency":"USD","headline":"Global Eggs Receives Investment of Up to $1 Billion from Warburg Pincus","summary":"Warburg Pincus agreed to invest up to $1 billion in table-egg producer Global Eggs at an $8 billion valuation, from its Capital Solutions Founders Fund.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/03/02/global-eggs-receives-investment-of-up-to-1-billion-from-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"New York, NY, March 2, 2026 – Warburg Pincus, the pioneer of global growth investing, today announced an agreement to invest up to $1 billion in Global Eggs (“the Company”), the largest multinational producer and distributor of table eggs. Valuing the Company at $8 billion, the investment underscores Warburg Pincus’ commitment to partnering with exceptional founders and investing in global companies with high growth potential.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:9f1fb7b5e17fd7a86aa78cc6cfdeb98d","date":"2026-02-09","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Evelyn Partners","portco_name":"Evelyn Partners","target_website":"evelyn.com","investor":"NatWest Group plc","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"Permira and Warburg Pincus","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":2700000000.0,"currency":"GBP","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Permira and Warburg Pincus agree to sell Evelyn Partners to NatWest","summary":"Permira and Warburg Pincus agreed to sell UK wealth manager Evelyn Partners to NatWest Group.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2026/02/09/permira-and-warburg-pincus-agree-to-sell-evelyn-partners-to-natwest/","evidence":"Permira, Warburg Pincus and Evelyn Partners are pleased to announce they have successfully reached an agreement with NatWest Group plc for it to acquire Evelyn Partners for a £2.7 billion enterprise value.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:18db8591639715ecb21e0e86bb8e8461","date":"2026-01-14","date_text":