4 Billion by Permira and Warburg Pincus, Supported by Francisco Partners and With Participation From Temasek","summary":"Clearwater Analytics agreed to be taken private at $24.55 per share by a Permira and Warburg Pincus-led group with Temasek participating and support from Francisco Partners.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/12/21/clearwater-analytics-to-be-acquired-for-8-4-billion-by-permira-and-warburg-pincus-supported-by-francisco-partners-and-with-participation-from-temasek/","evidence":"BOISE, Idaho--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Clearwater Analytics (NYSE: CWAN) (“CWAN” or the “Company”), announced that it has entered into a definitive agreement to be acquired in a transaction valued at approximately $8.4 billion by a Permira and Warburg Pincus-led Investor Group (the “Investor Group”), with participation from Temasek.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:4d78e9a4b065f2a0a40a2f1f22a5f3fe","date":"2025-12-21","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Clearwater Analytics","portco_name":"Clearwater Analytics","target_website":"cwan.com","investor":"Private Credit at Goldman Sachs Alternatives","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Clearwater Analytics to Be Acquired for $8.4 Billion by Permira and Warburg Pincus, Supported by Francisco Partners and With Participation From Temasek","summary":"Goldman Sachs Alternatives' private credit arm committed all of the debt financing for the Clearwater Analytics take-private; no amount is stated.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/12/21/clearwater-analytics-to-be-acquired-for-8-4-billion-by-permira-and-warburg-pincus-supported-by-francisco-partners-and-with-participation-from-temasek/","evidence":"Private Credit at Goldman Sachs Alternatives provided 100% committed debt financing to the Investor Group.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:782565e6d11d5d61b4343b1fd6851919","date":"2025-12-17","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Acclime","portco_name":"Acclime","target_website":"acclime.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus Signs Agreement to Invest in Acclime, a Leading Tech-Forward Corporate and Business Services Provider in Asia Pacific","summary":"Warburg Pincus signed an agreement to invest in Asia Pacific corporate and business services provider Acclime; size and stake are not stated.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/12/17/warburg-pincus-signs-agreement-to-invest-in-acclime-a-leading-tech-forward-corporate-and-business-services-provider-in-asia-pacific/","evidence":"Singapore / Hong Kong, December 17, 2025 – Warburg Pincus, the pioneer of global growth investing, today announced that it has signed an agreement to invest in Acclime, a leading provider of corporate and business services across Asia Pacific.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:e865be42ea71ad05649a0489f5d2d7ee","date":"2025-11-25","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Topcast Aviation Supplies Company Limited","portco_name":"Topcast","target_website":"topcast.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus Acquires Topcast, Asia Pacific’s Largest Independent Aircraft Parts Distributor and MRO Service Provider in the Civil Aviation Industry","summary":"Warburg Pincus acquired Hong Kong-based Topcast, Asia Pacific's largest independent civil aviation parts distributor and MRO provider.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/11/25/warburg-pincus-acquires-topcast-asia-pacifics-largest-independent-aircraft-parts-distributor-and-mro-service-provider-in-the-civil-aviation-industry/","evidence":"Hong Kong, November 25, 2025 – Warburg Pincus, the pioneer of global growth investing, today announced the acquisition of Topcast Aviation Supplies Company Limited (“Topcast”), the largest independent distributor of civil aviation parts and Maintenance, Repair, and Overhaul (MRO) service provider in Asia Pacific.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:6695da3bf74a73f606171326bab90618","date":"2025-11-13","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"ECN Capital","portco_name":"ECN Capital","target_website":"ecncapitalcorp.com","investor":"Investor group led by Warburg Pincus LLC","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1900000000.0,"currency":"CAD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"ECN Capital enters into definitive agreement to be acquired by an investor group led by Warburg Pincus","summary":"ECN Capital agreed to be taken private by a Warburg Pincus-led investor group for C$3.10 per common share in cash.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/11/13/ecn-capital-enters-into-definitive-agreement-to-be-acquired-by-an-investor-group-led-by-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Common shareholders will receive C$3.10 per common share, in cash, which represents a premium of approximately 13% over ECN Capital’s unaffected closing share price of C$2.75 on the Toronto Stock Exchange on November 12, 2025, and a premium of approximately 12% over ECN Capital’s 10-day volume weighted average trading price as of such date, valuing ECN Capital at an enterprise value of approximately C$1.9 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:532d31c1ab920be4a1695404826462f4","date":"2025-11-13","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"VOLL","portco_name":"VOLL","target_website":"govoll.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Localiza","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":120000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus acquires a controlling stake in VOLL with a +$120 million investment","summary":"Warburg Pincus bought a controlling stake in Brazilian corporate travel platform VOLL from Localiza with an investment of over $120 million that includes primary capital.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/11/13/warburg-pincus-acquires-a-controlling-stake-in-voll-with-a-120-million-investment/","evidence":"São Paulo, November 13, 2025 – Warburg Pincus has acquired a controlling stake in VOLL, Latin America’s leading next-generation corporate travel management platform from Localiza. The investment of +$120m also includes a primary portion to accelerate VOLL’s efforts to transform corporate travel and expense management with AI-powered solutions.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:9ad5520019f008c97f41f1315ef88b30","date":"2025-10-27","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Madison International Realty strategic partnership","portco_name":"Madison International Realty","target_website":"madisonint.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus Capital Solutions Founders Fund","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Madison International Realty"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":300000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus and Madison International Realty Form $300 Million Strategic Partnership","summary":"Warburg Pincus and real estate secondaries firm Madison International Realty formed a $300 million vehicle to invest together in real estate secondaries.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/10/27/warburg-pincus-and-madison-international-realty-form-300-million-strategic-partnership/","evidence":"New York, October 27, 2025— Warburg Pincus, a leading global private equity investor with $85 billion AUM, and Madison International Realty (“Madison”), a leading real estate secondaries firm, today announced the formation of a $300 million strategic investment partnership.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:52e075df283c3ee89cc028981296fa90","date":"2025-10-16","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Sebia","portco_name":"Sebia","target_website":"sebia.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Sebia and Warburg Pincus Partner to Drive Innovation in Diagnostics","summary":"Warburg Pincus entered exclusive negotiations to buy a significant minority stake in diagnostics company Sebia, with CVC Funds, La Caisse and Téthys Invest remaining significant investors; terms not disclosed.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2025/10/16/sebia-and-warburg-pincus-partner-to-drive-innovation-in-diagnostics/","evidence":"Lisses, Amsterdam and London, 16 October 2025 – Sebia, a global leader in specialty diagnostics, and Warburg Pincus, the pioneer of private equity global growth investing, today announced that Warburg Pincus has entered into exclusive negotiations for the potential acquisition of a significant minority stake in Sebia.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:08356702fdad797f75f4c36bf62e1ddf","date":"2025-