.com/2024/09/10/redwood-to-be-acquired-by-vista-equity-partners-and-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Frisco, TX – September 10, 2024 – Redwood Software (“Redwood”), a leader in automation fabric solutions, today announced that it has agreed to be acquired by funds affiliated with Vista Equity Partners (“Vista”), a global investment firm focused exclusively on enterprise software, data and technology-enabled businesses, and Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:a201da0baba39f2a344ed81dbb89f975","date":"2024-09-03","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Aztec Group","portco_name":"Aztec Group","target_website":"aztec.group","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Aztec Group welcomes Warburg Pincus as strategic partner","summary":"Fund administrator Aztec Group took Warburg Pincus on as a minority shareholder and key client.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2024/09/03/aztec-group-welcomes-warburg-pincus-as-strategic-partner/","evidence":"3 September 2024 – Aztec Group (“Aztec” or the “Group”), a leading international fund and corporate services provider, has today announced it has welcomed Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, as a strategic partner, which will see Warburg Pincus become a minority shareholder and key client of the Group.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:66d230dc1d193ad0b245d50777579151","date":"2024-08-26","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Singapore business park and industrial portfolio (Warburg Pincus–Lendlease JV)","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"Warburg Pincus–Lendlease JV platform and LINO","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investo