an-agreement-to-sell-procare-solutions-to-roper-technologies/","evidence":"NEW YORK, January 25, 2024 – Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, today announced the signing of a definitive agreement to sell Procare Solutions (“Procare”), a leading provider of integrated child care center management software and payments processing, to Roper Technologies, Inc. (“Roper”) (Nasdaq: ROP), for a total enterprise value of $1.86 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:eb30b968e3ca6f03850c357e020f9fb5","date":"2024-01-17","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Service Compression","portco_name":"Service Compression","target_website":"servicecompression.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus Capital Solutions Founders Fund","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Service Compression Accelerates Growth Strategy with Investment from Warburg Pincus","summary":"Natural gas compression provider Service Compression closed a preferred equity investment from Warburg Pincus's Capital Solutions fund alongside a new J.P. Morgan-led credit facility.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2024/01/17/service-compression-accelerates-growth-strategy-with-investment-from-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Lubbock, Texas (January 17, 2024) – Service Compression, LLC (“Service Compression” or the “Company”), a leading provider of natural gas compression services for exploration and production companies, today announced the closing of a preferred equity investment from Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, through its Capital Solutions Founders Fund.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:7260a5d9a14a12881c562d5cfaea4a95","date":"2024-01-17","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Service Compression","portco_name":"Service Compression","target_website":"servicecompression.com","investor":"J.P. Morgan","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Service Compression Accelerates Growth Strategy with Investment from Warburg Pincus","summary":"Alongside Warburg Pincus's preferred equity, Service Compression arranged a new credit facility led by J.P. Morgan to refinance its Crestline facility; no amount stated.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2024/01/17/service-compression-accelerates-growth-strategy-with-investment-from-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Warburg Pincus’ investment comes alongside a new credit facility led by J.P. Morgan and an additional capital raise led by existing and new shareholders.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:980943c11a04e8668018833e9436e349","date":"2023-12-19","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"QUBE Industrial","portco_name":"QUBE Industrial","target_website":null,"investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["MQ Logistics"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus and MQ Logistics Establish Joint Venture – QUBE Industrial to Capture Logistics Real Estate Opportunities in South Korea","summary":"Warburg Pincus and MQ Logistics formed QUBE Industrial, a South Korean logistics real estate joint venture seeded with four Greater Seoul warehouses.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2023/12/19/warburg-pincus-and-mq-logistics-establish-joint-venture-qube-industrial-to-capture-logistics-real-estate-opportunities-in-south-korea/","evidence":"QUBE Industrial is seeded with 4 institutional quality modern logistics warehouses located in prime sub-markets of Greater Seoul Area, with a total gross floor area (GFA) of more than 300,000 square meters","verified":null},{"key":"pr:14c66af1da1a84e0051d332e4e6200f0","date":"2023-12-12","date_text":null,"kind":"add_on_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Exercite","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"Epassi Group","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":"Waterland Private Equity and founders","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"TA and Warburg Pincus Complete Epassi Group Acquisition and Simultaneously Announce Transformational Acquisition of Exercite from Waterland","summary":"Epassi, newly majority-owned by TA and Warburg Pincus, agreed to buy German and Dutch corporate wellness provider Exercite from Waterland.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2023/12/12/ta-and-warburg-pincus-complete-epassi-group-acquisition-and-simultaneously-announce-transformational-acquisition-of-exercite-from-waterland/","evidence":"Helsinki – 12 December 2023 – Epassi Group (“Epassi” or “the Company”), a market leader for digital employee benefit payments in the Nordics, UK and Italy, today announced the strategic acquisition of Exercite, a provider of corporate health and wellness benefit solutions in Germany and the Netherlands, from Waterland Private Equity (“Waterland”) and its founders.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:d358bfda35fa0f24556d28fd6824e431","date":"2023-10-03","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"iNRCORE, LLC","portco_name":"iNRCORE","target_website":"inrcore.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus LLC","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["TJC"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline"