rburg Pincus affiliate agreed to buy a majority stake in Indian MSME lender Vistaar Finance, with WestBridge, Elevar, Omidyar Network India and Saama exiting.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/10/10/warburg-pincus-to-acquire-majority-stake-in-vistaar-finance-indias-leading-micro-enterprise-lender/","evidence":"Mumbai, Monday, October 10, 2022: Warburg Pincus a leading global private equity firm focused on growth investments, today announced that an affiliate of private equity funds managed by Warburg Pincus LLC, has entered into definitive agreements to acquire a majority stake in Vistaar Finance, an NBFC lending to MSMEs in India.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:2d4ac7de34853dac1271b72a9a58849f","date":"2022-08-05","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Montana Renewables LLC","portco_name":"Montana Renewables","target_website":"montanarenewables.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":250000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":2250000000.0,"valuation_currency":"USD","headline":"Calumet Announces Series of Transactions at Montana Renewables","summary":"Warburg Pincus agreed to invest $250 million of participating preferred equity in Calumet's renewable fuels subsidiary Montana Renewables at a $2.25 billion pre-commissioning enterprise value.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/08/05/calumet-announces-series-of-transactions-at-montana-renewables/","evidence":"Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, has agreed to invest $250 million in MRL in the form of a participating preferred equity security, which values MRL at a pre-commissioning enterprise value of $2.25 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:e9c093aa71b3dfcbf861ba5362895fd7","date":"2022-08-05","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Montana Renewables LLC","portco_name":"Montana Renewables","target_website":"montanarenewables.com","investor":"Stonebriar Commercial Finance","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":350000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"debt","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Calumet Announces Series of Transactions at Montana Renewables","summary":"Stonebriar Commercial Finance invested a further $350 million in Montana Renewables through sale and leaseback contracts, alongside Warburg Pincus's preferred equity.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/08/05/calumet-announces-series-of-transactions-at-montana-renewables/","evidence":"Calumet also announced that Stonebriar Commercial Finance (“Stonebriar”) has invested an additional $350 million through a pair of sale and leaseback contracts on top of its existing $50 million commitment to MRL.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:5b9a26b3a3c40aa9d739808b881f8892","date":"2022-07-19","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Internet Brands","portco_name":"Internet Brands","target_website":"internetbrands.com","investor":"Group of new investors led by Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["KKR","Temasek"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":12000000000.0,"valuation_currency":"USD","headline":"Internet Brands Completes Multibillion-Dollar Recapitalization with KKR, Temasek and Warburg Pincus to Drive Further Growth","summary":"Internet Brands completed a recapitalization with KKR and Temasek and new investors led by Warburg Pincus at a valuation above $12 billion; KKR remains majority owner.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/07/19/internet-brands-completes-multibillion-