th Mubadala, completed its acquisition of Pharma Intelligence (Citeline and other brands) from Informa, which kept a 15% interest.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/06/01/completion-of-pharma-intelligence-acquisition-by-warburg-pincus-from-informa-plc-and-appointment-of-executive-chair/","evidence":"LONDON/NEW YORK, June 1 2022 – Pharma Intelligence, a leading provider of specialist intelligence, data, and software for clinical trials, drug development, and regulatory compliance, announces that Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, has completed its acquisition of the business from Informa PLC (LSE:INF.L), the international Academic Markets, B2B Markets and Digital Services Group.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:a04af25c0f363ea5d3b5cde5d35bf9e8","date":"2022-04-11","date_text":null,"kind":"ipo","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"GoTo Group (PT GoTo Gojek Tokopedia Tbk)","portco_name":"GoTo Group","target_website":"gotocompany.com","investor":"IPO investors (Indonesia Stock Exchange)","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1100000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"GoTo Completes Landmark Listing on Indonesia Stock Exchange","summary":"Warburg Pincus portfolio company GoTo Group listed on the Indonesia Stock Exchange, raising about US$1.1 billion in its IPO.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/04/11/goto-completes-landmark-listing-on-indonesia-stock-exchange/","evidence":"The Company raised approximately US$1.1 billion from its Initial Public Offering (IPO) process, with the participation of around 300,000 investors – the highest-ever number to take part in an IPO on the IDX.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:7f34675f7e90e23c42e1b42ce3fda63a","date":"2022-04-05","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"ClimeCo","portco_name":"ClimeCo","target_website":"climeco.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["The Heritage Group"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":50000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus and The Heritage Group Invest in ClimeCo to Expand Global Decarbonization Platform","summary":"Environmental commodities developer ClimeCo raised over $50 million in a round led by Warburg Pincus and The Heritage Group.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/04/05/warburg-pincus-and-the-heritage-group-invest-in-climeco-to-expand-global-decarbonization-platform/","evidence":"BOYERTOWN, Pennsylvania (April 5, 2022) – ClimeCo, a global company that focuses on developing and trading environmental commodities and advising clients on emerging environmental market solutions, announced that it has raised over $50 million in an investment round led by Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, and The Heritage Group, which made ClimeCo’s first outside capital investment in early 2021.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:ec498b8a02a0a0e60537d47c5dbc173a","date":"2022-03-28","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Ensemble Health Partners","portco_name":"Ensemble Health Partners","target_website":"ensemblehp.com","investor":"Berkshire Partners","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["Warburg Pincus"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Berkshire Partners and Warburg Pincus to partner for an investment in Ensemble Health Partners","summary":"Berkshire Partners and Warburg Pincus agreed to make a significant investment in revenue cycle management provider Ensemble Health Partners; Golden Gate Capital keeps a minority interest.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/03/28/berkshire-partners-and-warburg-pincus-to-partner-for-an-investment-in-ensemble-health-partners/","evidence":"Cincinnati, Ohio, March 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Ensemble Health Partners (“Ensemble” or “the Company”), a leading provider of technology-enabled revenue cycle management solutions for health systems, including hospitals and affiliated physician groups, announced today that Berkshire Partners and Warburg Pincus have entered into an agreement to make a significant investment in the Company.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:2c6ceac66d02ecd836bf86a632b3cbad","date":"2022-03-08","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Imperial Auto Industries Limited","portco_name":"Imperial Auto","target_website":"imperialauto.in","investor":"Stone Plant Investments B.V. (affiliate of Warburg Pincus)","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus to Invest in Imperial Auto, India’s Largest Manufacturer of Fluid Transmission Products","summary":"A Warburg Pincus affiliate acquired a majority stake in Indian fluid transmission products maker Imperial Auto.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/03/08/warburg-pincus-to-invest-in-imperial-auto-indias-largest-manufacturer-of-fluid-transmission-products/","evidence":"March 8, 2022: Stone Plant Investments B.V., an affiliate of Warburg Pincus, a leading global private equity firm, has acquired a majority stake in Imperial Auto Industries Limited and its affiliated companies (“Imperial” or the “Group”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:2a91352b09b1d48c07e7a68f2e0ca4f4","date":"2022-02-22","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_