dline":"Eco Material Technologies Created Through Combination of Boral Resources and Green Cement","summary":"Newly formed Eco Material Technologies, backed by One Equity Partners and Warburg Pincus, completed the acquisitions of Boral's North American fly ash business and Green Cement.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/02/10/eco-material-technologies-created-through-combination-of-boral-resources-and-green-cement/","evidence":"New York, February 10, 2022 – Eco Material Technologies (“Eco Material” or the “Company”), a leading producer of sustainable cementitious materials, today announced that it has completed the acquisitions of Boral Resources (“Boral”), Boral Limited’s (ASX: BLD) North American fly ash business, and Green Cement Inc. (“Green Cement”), a manufacturer of near-zero carbon cement alternatives.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:ac72a5dd223fe34dec11428c16b3b7c4","date":"2022-02-10","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Eco Material Technologies","portco_name":"Eco Material Technologies LLC","target_website":"ecomaterial.com","investor":"Green Bond holders","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":525000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"debt","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Eco Material Technologies Created Through Combination of Boral Resources and Green Cement","summary":"Eco Material Technologies priced and closed $525 million of Green Bonds to fund its formation combination.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/02/10/eco-material-technologies-created-through-combination-of-boral-resources-and-green-cement/","evidence":"Along with these investments, the Company priced and closed $525 million of Green Bonds to facilitate the combination transaction.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:bbae86160afdf033579bf875f641bdcc","date":"2022-02-10","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Pharma Intelligence (Norstella / Citeline)","portco_name":"Pharma Intelligence (Norstella / Citeline)","target_website":"norstella.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Mubadala Investment Company"],"seller":"Informa PLC (retaining 15%)","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus Announces Acquisition Of Pharma Intelligence From Informa","summary":"Warburg Pincus announced the acquisition of Pharma Intelligence from Informa, with Mubadala joining the investment and Informa keeping 15%.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2022/02/10/warburg-pincus-announces-acquisition-of-pharma-intelligence-from-informa/","evidence":"LONDON, February 10, 2022 -- Warburg Pincus, a leading global growth investor, today announced the acquisition of Pharma Intelligence, a leading provider of specialist intelligence, data, and software for clinical trials, drug development, and regulatory compliance, from Informa PLC (LSE:INF.L), the international B2B markets knowledge services and business intelligence group.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:f4bc0bfb0a78f8662bd76cea87021fda","date":"2022-02-09","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Scandit","portco_name":"Scandit","target_website":"scandit.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Atomico","Forestay Capital","G2VP","GV","Kreos","NGP Capital","Schneider Electric","Sony Innovation Fund by IGV","Swisscom Ventures"],"seller":null,"round":"Series D","stake_pct":null,"amount":150000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":1000000000.0,"valuation_currency":"USD","headline":"Scandit, the Smart Data Capture Leader, announces $150m