ler","co_investors":[],"seller":"CPP Investments, Ontario Teachers' Pension Plan, Warburg Pincus and funds advised by Apax (Connect BidCo)","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":4000000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Inmarsat shareholder group supports combination with Viasat to create a new global communications innovator","summary":"Inmarsat's owners, including Warburg Pincus, agreed to combine it with Viasat for $850 million in cash and about 46.36 million Viasat shares.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2021/11/08/inmarsat-shareholder-group-supports-combination-with-viasat-to-create-a-new-global-communications-innovator/","evidence":"Under the terms of the agreement, Inmarsat shareholders will receive $4.0 billion composed of $850 million in cash, subject to adjustments, and approximately 46.36 million newly issued Viasat shares, which represent a 37.5% ownership on a fully diluted basis, valued at $3.1 billion, based on the closing price of $67.00 per Viasat share on November 5, 2021.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:80b88ad386feec8a6e45eacc83c9bfc9","date":"2021-11-02","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Mynt (GCash)","portco_name":"Mynt (GCash)","target_website":"gcash.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Insight Partners","Bow Wave Capital","Itai Tsiddon","Amplo Ventures","Globe","Ayala"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":300000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":2000000000.0,"valuation_currency":"USD","headline":"Mynt Secures $300M in Funding from Lead Investors Warburg Pincus, Insight Partners and Bow Wave","summary":"GCash operator Mynt raised over $300 million in a round led by Warburg Pincus, Insight Partners and Bow Wave, valuing it at over $2 billion.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","sour