/clearwater-analytics-announces-new-investment-from-leading-growth-investors-permira-warburg-pincus-dragoneer-and-durable-capital/","evidence":"BOISE, Idaho, Oct. 12, 2020 /PRNewswire/ -- Clearwater Analytics, the market-leading SaaS provider of investment accounting and analytics, announced today that it will receive a new investment led by investment firms Permira, Warburg Pincus, Dragoneer Investment Group and Durable Capital.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:6bcd78089644da386dc63b401cce1641","date":"2020-10-08","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Home First Finance Company India Ltd","portco_name":"Home First Finance Company India Limited","target_website":"homefirstindia.com","investor":"Orange Clove Investments BV (affiliate of Warburg Pincus)","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["True North (existing)","Bessemer Venture Partners (existing)"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":7000000000.0,"currency":"INR","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Warburg Pincus to invest $95MN (INR 700 CR) in Home First – One of India’s leading affordable housing finance companies","summary":"A Warburg Pincus affiliate agreed to invest about INR 700 crore ($95 million) in Home First Finance through primary capital and secondary purchases.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2020/10/08/warburg-pincus-to-invest-95mn-inr-700-cr-in-home-first-one-of-indias-leading-affordable-housing-finance-companies/","evidence":"The investment of approximately INR 700 crore is a combination of primary fund raise and secondary sales by existing shareholders.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:a60eca99719861d513fd69d608ee313e","date":"2020-10-07","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Take Blip","portco_name":"Take Blip","target_website":"blip.ai","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_