 Commitment of up to $300 Million from Warburg Pincus","summary":"Distributed clean energy platform Scale Microgrid Solutions secured an equity commitment of up to $300 million from Warburg Pincus.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2020/01/27/scale-microgrid-solutions-announces-equity-commitment-of-up-to-300-million-from-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Ridgewood, NJ – January 27, 2020 – Scale Microgrid Solutions (“SMS”), a leading distributed clean energy and microgrid platform, today announced that it has secured an equity commitment of up to $300 million from Warburg Pincus, a global private equity firm focused on growth investing.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:aee3ad013e4e90826b39b36f8529e2b9","date":"2020-01-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Sundyne, LLC","portco_name":"Sundyne, LLC","target_website":"sundyne.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"BC Partners Advisors L.P. and The Carlyle Group","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Sundyne announces sale from BC Partners and The Carlyle Group to Warburg Pincus","summary":"Warburg Pincus agreed to acquire pump and compressor maker Sundyne from BC Partners and Carlyle; terms not disclosed.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2020/01/06/sundyne-announces-sale-from-bc-partners-and-the-carlyle-group-to-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Denver CO., January 6, 2020 – Sundyne, a global leader in the design and manufacture of mission critical flow control equipment, today announced that funds advised by Warburg Pincus, a leading private equity firm focused on growth investing, has agreed to acquire the company from funds advised by BC Partners Advisors L.P. and The Carlyle Group.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:6b4d252e4cf91fe3c871174