":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2019/12/10/warburg-pincus-and-vivtera-announce-investment-in-arise-virtual-solutions/","evidence":"Investment will accelerate gig workforce opportunities through technology-enabled innovation, superior customer experience and global expansionNEW YORK, NY, MUMBAI, India and MIRAMAR, FL, December 10, 2019 – An affiliate of Warburg Pincus, a global private equity firm focused on growth investing, and Vivtera, a global business process management (“BPM”) and transformation partner, today announced the acquisition of Arise Virtual Solutions (“Arise”), a leading provider of business process services from the previous investor, Strait Lane Capital Partners (“Strait Lane”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:4b24dfc6d3c6ccc2cb144a81170ab8fa","date":"2019-11-19","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Perfios Software Solutions","portco_name":"Perfios Software Solutions","target_website":"perfios.com","investor":"private equity funds managed by Warburg Pincus LLC","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Bessemer Venture Partners"],"seller":null,"round":"Series B","stake_pct":null,"amount":50000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Leading Fintech Player Perfios Announces Investment from Warburg Pincus and Bessemer Venture Partners","summary":"Indian fintech software company Perfios raised a roughly USD 50 million Series B led by Warburg Pincus and Bessemer, including secondary purchases from angels.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2019/11/19/leading-fintech-player-perfios-announces-investment-from-warburg-pincus-and-bessemer-venture-partners/","evidence":"The investment amount was approximately USD 50 million, and includes primary capital infusion into the company and purchase of shares from early angel investors.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:380