burg-pincus/","evidence":"Deerfield, Ill., June 5, 2019—Warburg Pincus, a leading global private equity firm focused on growth investing, has agreed to acquire Pregis LLC, a leading protective packaging materials and automated systems manufacturer, from Olympus Partners, headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut, for an undisclosed amount.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:8970f3745d96664fddf01844b62cee89","date":"2019-05-30","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Inspired Education","portco_name":"Inspired Education","target_website":"inspirededu.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["TA Associates (existing shareholder)"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Inspired Welcomes Warburg Pincus as a New Investor","summary":"Warburg Pincus agreed to invest in premium schools group Inspired alongside existing shareholder TA Associates; terms not disclosed.","source_name":"Warburg Pincus","source_url":"https://warburgpincus.com/2019/05/30/inspired-welcomes-warburg-pincus-as-a-new-investor/","evidence":"London and New York – 30th May 2019 – Warburg Pincus, a leading global private equity firm focused on growth investing, has reached an agreement to invest in Inspired, a leading group of premium schools in Europe, Africa, Latin America and Asia Pacific, along with existing shareholders TA Associates.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:d5bb1214e13b77b36da54c6f08d4ce62","date":"2019-05-02","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"McGill and Partners","portco_name":"McGill and Partners","target_website":"mcgillpartners.com","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Management (Steve McGill and team)"],"seller":null,"round":"seed","stake_pct":null,"amount":250000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis