es-123-9-million-to-fuel-new-stage-of-growth/","evidence":"Varo Bank said its all-digital nationally chartered bank is entering a new stage of growth after raising $123.9 million in a Series G round led by existing investor Warburg Pincus and new investor Coliseum Capital Management.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:d1f8fcf16111270c00421424efef28b0","date":"2024-11-19","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Blip","portco_name":"Blip","target_website":"blip.ai","investor":"Warburg Pincus","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Accel","SoftBank","Microsoft"],"seller":null,"round":"Series C","stake_pct":null,"amount":60000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Blip raises $60M in series C round led by Warburg Pincus","summary":"Brazilian conversational platform Blip raised a $60 million Series C led by Warburg Pincus with Accel, SoftBank and Microsoft.","source_name":"LatamList","source_url":"https://latamlist.com/blip-raises-60m-in-series-c-round-led-by-warburg-pincus/","evidence":"Conversational platform Blip raised a $60M Series C round led by Warburg Pincus, with participation from existing investors Accel, SoftBank, and Microsoft.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:ebe28d832482ff6a75ee8b2bbb3eda99","date":"2023-07-24","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Once For All","portco_name":"Once For All","target_website":"onceforall.com","investor":"GTCR","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"Warburg Pincus","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"GTCR to Acquire Once For All from Warburg Pincus","summary":"GTCR agreed to acquire compliance and supply chain software provider Once For All (formerly Constructionline) from Warburg Pincus; terms not disclosed.","source_n